{
 "strategy": "L39_relative_vigor",
 "name": "Relative Vigor Index (Ehlers): cruzamento com a linha de sinal, filtro de tendência e zona",
 "family": "oscilador",
 "sources": [
  "John F. Ehlers, 'Something Old, Something New', Technical Analysis of Stocks & Commodities, jan/2002",
  "https://www.luxalgo.com/library/indicator/relative-vigor-index/",
  "https://capital.com/en-gb/learn/technical-analysis/relative-vigor-index",
  "TradingView embutido RVGI (Pine: rvi = sum(swma(close-open),len)/sum(swma(high-low),len); sig = swma(rvi)), port em github.com/deepentropy/lightweight-charts-indicators src/standard/rvi.ts"
 ],
 "rule": "RVGI = soma(len) de swma(C-O) / soma(len) de swma(H-L), sinal = swma(RVGI), swma=(x+2x1+2x2+x3)/6. Compra quando RVGI cruza acima do sinal (se trend>0: fechamento acima da EMA(trend); se zona=1: RVGI<0 no cruzamento); vende (both) no espelho. Sai no cruzamento oposto. Stop k*ATR14.",
